1
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:19,080
It happened right after the
three-legged race with Asia.

2
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:23,500
You must be from the Hero Faction
of the Chaos Brigade.

3
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:27,630
The Three Great Powers entrusted
us to protect this town.

4
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,960
We won't let you do what you please!

5
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,760
As I thought, a possessor of a Sacred Gear!

6
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:37,430
I won't let him touch a single
hair on President's head!

7
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:51,940
What the hell is this?!

8
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:04,290
Sorry! I'm having you help me
with my training at a time like this.

9
00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:05,460
It's fine.

10
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:08,290
Spending the morning in 
Kyoto with Issei is fun.

11
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:12,380
Only daily training can shorten the
power gap between two people.

12
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:15,510
Don't you think having more people will help?

13
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:17,800
Come on, let's try our best!

14
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,930
Hold on, Xenovia. Today, too?

15
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:22,640
Yeah, of course.

16
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,730
I plan to take it along sightseeing, too.

17
00:01:24,730 --> 00:01:26,560
This isn't just a souvenir!

18
00:01:28,810 --> 00:01:31,520
Xenovia, you should use this
if something happens.

19
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:36,150
Thank you. I'll be able to conceal
this while walking around.

20
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:39,160
I'll always be prepared for an enemy attack.

21
00:01:39,370 --> 00:01:40,780
Enemy, huh?

22
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:44,830
It definitely looks like the
Chaos Brigade is making a move in Kyoto.

23
00:01:45,370 --> 00:01:47,080
It'll be troublesome if something happens.

24
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:48,190
Yeah.

25
00:01:48,830 --> 00:01:50,000
All right!

26
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,840
Let's do some sparring
until the morning roll call!

