00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:18,640
I'm happy, but it's so hard to breathe!

7520
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:21,940
The closet isn't just small,
there's not enough oxygen!

7521
00:15:26,780 --> 00:15:30,030
Th-This feeling...

7522
00:15:30,030 --> 00:15:36,410
This is my first time,
so I don't know what to do...

7523
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:43,460
Is this how it feels to hug an angel?

7524
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:50,720
All of you...!

7525
00:15:55,510 --> 00:16:00,270
It surprised me when they said
those things, but it made me happy.

7526
00:16:00,270 --> 00:16:05,900
I always fail to make a move when it counts.

7527
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:08,730
At this rate, I won't be able
to become the Harem King.

7528
00:16:08,730 --> 00:16:10,740
I know that!

7529
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:15,120
And at this rate, my relationship
with the president will never...

7530
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:18,290
Of course, I know she's
a flower out of my reach.

7531
00:16:18,290 --> 00:16:21,330
Even so, my feelings for the president...!

7532
00:16:21,330 --> 00:16:23,370
I wish I had some kind of chance.

7533
00:16:23,370 --> 00:16:26,670
Hey, Issei. Why are you
making such a troubled face?

7534
00:16:26,670 --> 00:16:28,550
N-No, no reason.

7535
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:31,420
Whoa, no matter how many times
I see it, it's pretty amazing.

7536
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:34,800
Yeah, well injuries come along
with the blossoming of youth.

7537
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:38,560
It was our mistake, but there are no regrets.

7538
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:41,230
Hey, Hyoudou. Are you waiting for someone?

7539
00:16:41,230 --> 00:16:42,230
Yeah.

7540
00:16:44,190 --> 00:16:46,230
Looks like you have all arrived.

7541
00:16:47,310 --> 00:16:49,730
Oh, there you are, Kunou!

7542
00:16:49,730 --> 00:16:53,570
What? Issei, you hit on a
girl this small in Kyoto?

7543
00:16:53,570 --> 00:16:55,530
She's small and cute.

7544
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:58,030
Aw, she's so cute!

7545
00:16:58,030 --> 00:17:00,950
What? Where did you meet her, Hyodo?

7546
00:17:00,950 --> 00:17:04,000
Let go! What an overly friendly little girl!

7547
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:06,250
She even talks like a little princess.

7548
00:17:06,250 --> 00:17:08,250
Her character is perfect!

7549
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:12,970
This is Kunou. She is 
an acquaintance of ours.

7550
00:17:12,970 --> 00:17:15,630
I thought I would guide you all on a tour.

7551
00:17:15,630 --> 00:17:17,850
Sorry for having you join
us at a time like this.

7552
00:17:17,850 --> 00:17:18,930
Not a problem.

7553
00:17:18,930 --> 00:17:23,020
Mother would scold me if I could
not fulfill a promise I have made.

7554
00:17:23,020 --> 00:17:24,640
There is no need to be reserved!

7555
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:28,650
Got it. Then, please take care of us today!

