7567
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:02,100
Boiled Tofu

7568
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:05,020
The boiled tofu here is the best.

7569
00:18:07,230 --> 00:18:09,900
Yeah, you're right! It's delicious!

7570
00:18:12,730 --> 00:18:15,530
I could eat boiled tofu every day.

7571
00:18:15,530 --> 00:18:17,910
Boiled tofu is excellent!

7572
00:18:17,910 --> 00:18:21,620
Boiled tofu every day...
You must really like it.

7573
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:27,290
But, in the end, Mother's boiled
tofu is the most delicious.

7574
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:30,460
I see. Your mother's is the best.

7575
00:18:30,460 --> 00:18:31,460
Hm?

7576
00:18:33,670 --> 00:18:35,550
Have some seconds.

7577
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:36,970
Thanks, Kunou.

7578
00:18:40,300 --> 00:18:42,010
What a coincidence.

7579
00:18:42,010 --> 00:18:43,970
Oh, Kiba.

7580
00:18:43,970 --> 00:18:45,520
Hello, everyone.

7581
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:50,060
And you must be Kunou?
I've heard of you from Azazel.

7582
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:52,020
Nice to meet you.

7583
00:18:52,020 --> 00:18:54,020
I see. You are also...

7584
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:55,440
Please take care of us.

7585
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:58,610
See you. Maybe we'll see each other
around the Togetsukyo Bridge.

7586
00:18:58,610 --> 00:19:02,410
Arashiyama in autumn is truly elegant.

7587
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:03,660
Azazel!

7588
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:06,330
Hey! Should a teacher be drinking
in the afternoon like that?!

7589
00:19:06,330 --> 00:19:07,870
Exactly right.

7590
00:19:07,870 --> 00:19:09,790
And in front of the students!

7591
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:12,960
But no matter what I say, he won't listen.

7592
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:17,210
Now, don't be like that.
It's just a little break.

7593
00:19:17,210 --> 00:19:21,300
And, Rossweisse. You need
to be a little more flexible.

7594
00:19:21,300 --> 00:19:23,760
That's why you can't find a man...

7595
00:19:25,850 --> 00:19:28,060
Th-This has nothing to do
with having a boyfriend!

7596
00:19:28,060 --> 00:19:29,640
Please don't make fun of me!

7597
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,980
Goodness, if you're going 
to drink it anyways...!

7598
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:35,730
Rossweisse?

7599
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:42,070
S-She's drunk from one drink?

7600
00:19:42,070 --> 00:19:45,330
To begin with, alcohol wush my friend

7601
00:19:45,330 --> 00:19:50,830
ever since I shtarted workin'
under that shitty old man Ohdin...

7602
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:56,500
Dats why...! Dats why I 
can't get uh boyfrund!

7603
00:19:56,500 --> 00:20:00,880
Hurry up and go. I'll 
deal with her complaints.

7604
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:06,510
Rheely?! Azazel! You huv
some gud qualities, too!

7605
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:08,140
Hey!

7606
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:10,850
Jeez, this is quite a problem.

7607
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:13,350
Shaki, ten moar orders!

7608
00:20:13,350 --> 00:20:14,190
Huh?!

7609
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:18,150
Rossweisse went out of control.

7610
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:19,110
Yeah.

7611
00:20:19,110 --> 00:20:21,360
Hey, did you guys know?

7612
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:25,370
You shouldn't look back until you
completely cross Togetsukyo Bridge.

7613
00:20:25,370 --> 00:20:26,450
Why?

7614
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:31,040
That's because if you look back, all the
knowledge you received gets returned.

7615
00:20:31,410 --> 00:20:34,460
It'd be all over for you three.

7616
00:20:34,460 --> 00:20:36,920
You guys will all become idiots
that truly can't be saved.

7617
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:37,920
Shut up!

7618
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:39,710
There's one more.

7619
00:20:39,710 --> 00:20:43,270
They say if a couple looks back,
they'll break up.

7620
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:45,890
I will not look back, no matter what!

7621
00:20:53,100 --> 00:20:54,020
What?

7622
00:20:54,650 --> 00:20:56,480
I remember seeing this fog before.

7623
00:20:56,980 --> 00:21:00,650
Dimension Lost. The power of a Longinus.

7624
00:21:01,030 --> 00:21:03,110
Azazel has told us about it before.

7625
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:05,820
Are you guys all right?!

7626
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:13,750
Everyone other than us have
disappeared from this area.

7627
00:21:14,370 --> 00:21:19,250
It looks like we've been forced
into another dimensional space.

7628
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:21,630
It can't be.

7629
00:21:21,630 --> 00:21:23,060
What's wrong, Kunou?

7630
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:28,720
I heard Mother was enveloped in a
similar fog when she was kidnapped.

7631
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:30,170
Then, this is...

7632
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:59,750
Nice to meet you, Governor-General Azazel.

7633
00:21:59,750 --> 00:22:01,090
And...

7634
00:22:02,700 --> 00:22:04,400
Red Dragon Emperor.

